```

Applied essentially as suggested (kept the local `var ok` style used across this file). The function is now exported for the test surface, and three new tests pin the behavior: a `null` PATCH result produces no green check, logs the warning and returns `false`; a truthy gh output logs the check and returns `true`; an unsupported provider prints no green check either. Suite: `updatePullRequestBody > PATCH failure reporting (gh-960)` in `js/unit-tests/test_postTestReworkResults.js`.

